function sidebar(){const nav=[['overview','grid','Overview'],['advisor','chat','Find my bundle'],['products','catalogue','Explore products'],['lab','shield','Resilience Lab'],['tracker','box','My orders']];return `<aside class="sidebar ${state.mobileNav?'is-open':''}"><a class="brand" href="#overview" aria-label="Udyam Saathi home"><span class="brand-symbol">u<span>.</span></span><span>udyam<br><b>saathi<span class="red">.</span></b></span></a><div class="workspace-label">BUSINESS, SIMPLIFIED</div><nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">${nav.map(([id,ic,label])=>`<button class="nav-item ${state.view===id||(id==='advisor'&&['quote','kyc'].includes(state.view))?'active':''}" data-action="nav" data-view="${id}">${icon(ic)}<span>${label}</span>${id==='advisor'?'<span class="nav-dot"></span>':''}${id==='tracker'&&state.order?'<span class="nav-count">1</span>':''}</button>`).join('')}</nav><div class="sidebar-divider"></div><button class="nav-item ${state.view==='partners'?'active':''}" data-action="nav" data-view="partners">${icon('users')}<span>Partner workspace</span><span class="tiny-tag">DEMO</span></button><div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="help-card"><div class="help-card-top">${icon('chat')}<span>A little human help?</span></div><p>Some conversations are better with a person.</p><button data-action="support">Talk to a business expert ${icon('arrow')}</button></div><button class="nav-item subtle" data-action="privacy">${icon('shield')}Privacy & your data</button><div class="team-signature"><span class="avatar">pm<span>m</span></span><div><b>Ping Me Maybe</b><span>Airtel Sync 2026 · Digital Track</span></div></div></div></aside>`;}
function header(){return `<header class="topbar"><div class="topbar-left"><button class="icon-button mobile-only" aria-label="Toggle navigation" data-action="menu">${icon('menu')}</button><span class="breadcrumb">Workspace <span>/</span> <b>${({overview:'Overview',advisor:'Find my bundle',quote:'Your bundle',kyc:'Business verification',products:'Product catalogue',lab:'Resilience Lab',tracker:'My orders',partners:'Partner workspace'})[state.view]||'Overview'}</b></span></div><div class="topbar-right"><span class="prototype-label"><span></span> COMPETITION PROTOTYPE</span><button class="language-button" data-action="language" aria-label="Switch language">${icon('globe')}<span>${hi()?'हिन्दी':state.profile.language==='ta'?'தமிழ்':'English'}</span>${icon('chevron')}</button><button class="profile-avatar" data-action="team" aria-label="About Ping Me Maybe">PM</button></div></header>`;}
